WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Marcus Chen>Thanks for joining. Today we're reviewing the new route timeline for the dispatcher dashboard.

2
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Emily Park>I like the colour coding. My only worry is that late stops and skipped stops look almost the same.

3
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:49.000
<v Marcus Chen>Fair point. I'll add an icon to skipped stops so they don't rely on colour alone.

4
00:00:49.500 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Daniel Okafor>Customers keep asking to export the timeline. Could we add a download button next to the date picker?

5
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:25.000
<v Jordan Lee>Let's scope that as a follow-up. We need to ship the timeline itself first.

6
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:44.000
<v Daniel Okafor>That's fine. I'll collect the three accounts asking for it so we can talk to them next week.

7
00:01:44.500 --> 00:02:02.000
<v Emily Park>For the launch post, can you send me two screenshots of the timeline by Friday, Marcus?

8
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Marcus Chen>Yes, I'll export them from the final file.

9
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:30.000
<v Jordan Lee>Great. So the icon change, screenshots for Emily, and Daniel's customer list. Thanks all.
